{"seq":1,"slug":"operator-testing","title":"Operator 测试策略与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/operations/operator-testing","wordCount":1195,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"operator-测试策略与实践\">Operator 测试策略与实践</h1><p>Operator 本质是一个分布式系统组件——它在 Kubernetes API Server 的最终一致性环境中运行，管理有状态资源的复杂生命周期。测试 Operator 的难度远超普通的 Web 服务：你需要验证控制循环在各种故障场景下的正确性，包括资源冲突、网络分区、并发修改和崩溃恢复。一套完整的 Operator 测试策略需要覆盖从纯逻辑单元到真实集群端到端的全金字塔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>测试金字塔</strong>：单元（纯逻辑）→ 集成（envtest）→ E2E（真实集群）→ 混沌（故障注入），覆盖率与执行成本递增</li>\n<li><strong>envtest</strong>：controller-runtime 提供的测试框架，启动真实 API Server + etcd 但无 kubelet/scheduler</li>\n<li><strong>计算层分离</strong>：将 Reconciler 拆为纯计算层（可单元测试）和 API 交互层（需 envtest）</li>\n<li><strong>Eventually 模式</strong>：异步等待条件满足，避免脆弱的硬编码 Sleep</li>\n<li><strong>状态空间覆盖</strong>：关注正常路径、错误路径、边界条件、并发场景和恢复场景的全面覆盖</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"测试金字塔\">测试金字塔</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 金字塔&#10;        E2E[E2E 测试: 真实集群]&#10;        INT[集成测试: envtest]&#10;        UNIT[单元测试: 纯逻辑]&#10;    end&#10;    E2E --- |少量, 慢, 高置信度| INT&#10;    INT --- |中量, 快, 覆盖调谐| UNIT&#10;    UNIT --- |大量, 极快, 纯函数| BASE[基础]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 金字塔\n        E2E[E2E 测试: 真实集群]\n        INT[集成测试: envtest]\n        UNIT[单元测试: 纯逻辑]\n    end\n    E2E --- |少量, 慢, 高置信度| INT\n    INT --- |中量, 快, 覆盖调谐| UNIT\n    UNIT --- |大量, 极快, 纯函数| BASE[基础]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>运行时间</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>CI 频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>Go testing, testify</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>辅助函数、状态计算、转换逻辑</td>\n<td>每次 commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>envtest</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>Reconcile 循环、API 交互</td>\n<td>每次 commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>Kind/k3d + Ginkgo</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>完整部署、故障注入、升级</td>\n<td>每次 PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混沌测试</td>\n<td>Chaos Mesh / Litmus</td>\n<td>分钟-小时</td>\n<td>网络分区、Pod 杀死、时钟偏移</td>\n<td>定期/Release</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单元测试-纯逻辑验证\">单元测试：纯逻辑验证</h2><p>Operator 中的纯函数（状态计算、diff 算法、配置生成）应该与 Kubernetes API 完全解耦，作为纯单元测试验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 可纯函数测试的逻辑：根据 spec 生成期望的 StatefulSet spec&#10;func buildStatefulSetSpec(db *DatabaseSpec) appsv1.StatefulSetSpec {&#10;    // 纯计算，不依赖任何 client 或 context&#10;    return appsv1.StatefulSetSpec{&#10;        Replicas: ptr.To(db.Replicas),&#10;        Template: corev1.PodTemplateSpec{&#10;            Spec: corev1.PodSpec{&#10;                Containers: []corev1.Container{{&#10;                    Name:  &quot;database&quot;,&#10;                    Image: fmt.Sprintf(&quot;postgres:%s&quot;, db.Version),&#10;                    Resources: buildResourceRequirements(db),&#10;                }},&#10;            },&#10;        },&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;func TestBuildStatefulSetSpec(t *testing.T) {&#10;    spec := &amp;DatabaseSpec{Replicas: 3, Version: &quot;16.2&quot;}&#10;    result := buildStatefulSetSpec(spec)&#10;&#10;    assert.Equal(t, int32(3), *result.Replicas)&#10;    assert.Equal(t, &quot;postgres:16.2&quot;, result.Template.Spec.Containers[0].Image)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可纯函数测试的逻辑：根据 spec 生成期望的 StatefulSet spec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildStatefulSetSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DatabaseSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appsv1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StatefulSetSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 纯计算，不依赖任何 client 或 context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> appsv1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StatefulSetSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Replicas: ptr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">To</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db.Replicas),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Template: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PodTemplateSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Spec: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PodSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                Containers: []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    Name:  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    Image: fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"postgres:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, db.Version),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    Resources: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">buildResourceRequirements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestBuildStatefulSetSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    spec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DatabaseSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Replicas: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Version: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildStatefulSetSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(spec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.Replicas)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"postgres:16.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, result.Template.Spec.Containers[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].Image)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>设计原则</strong>：将 Reconciler 拆分为两层——纯计算层（可单元测试）和 API 交互层（需 envtest）。纯计算层接收数据、返回数据，不持有 client/context。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试-envtest\">集成测试：envtest</h2><p>envtest 是 controller-runtime 提供的测试框架——它启动一个真实的 API Server + etcd 进程（但不启动 kubelet/scheduler），让 Controller 在接近真实的环境中运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"var (&#10;    k8sClient client.Client&#10;    testEnv   *envtest.Environment&#10;    ctx       context.Context&#10;    cancel    context.CancelFunc&#10;)&#10;&#10;func TestMain(m *testing.M) {&#10;    testEnv = &amp;envtest.Environment{&#10;        CRDDirectoryPaths: []string{&#10;            filepath.Join(&quot;..&quot;, &quot;..&quot;, &quot;config&quot;, &quot;crd&quot;, &quot;bases&quot;),&#10;        },&#10;        ErrorIfCRDPathMissing: true,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    cfg, err := testEnv.Start()&#10;    // ... 初始化 client, 注册 scheme, 启动 manager&#10;&#10;    code := m.Run()&#10;    cancel()&#10;    testEnv.Stop()&#10;    os.Exit(code)&#10;}&#10;&#10;func TestDatabaseReconciler_CreatesPrimaryStatefulSet(t *testing.T) {&#10;    // Arrange: 创建 Database CR&#10;    db := &amp;databasev1.Database{&#10;        ObjectMeta: metav1.ObjectMeta{&#10;            Name:      &quot;test-db&quot;,&#10;            Namespace: &quot;default&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;        Spec: databasev1.DatabaseSpec{&#10;            Replicas: 3,&#10;            Engine:   &quot;postgres&quot;,&#10;            Version:  &quot;16.2&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;    }&#10;    require.NoError(t, k8sClient.Create(ctx, db))&#10;&#10;    // Assert: 等待 StatefulSet 被创建&#10;    sts := &amp;appsv1.StatefulSet{}&#10;    require.Eventually(t, func() bool {&#10;        err := k8sClient.Get(ctx, client.ObjectKey{&#10;            Namespace: &quot;default&quot;,&#10;            Name:      &quot;test-db-primary&quot;,&#10;        }, sts)&#10;        return err == nil&#10;    }, 10*time.Second, 250*time.Millisecond)&#10;&#10;    assert.Equal(t, int32(3), *sts.Spec.Replicas)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    k8sClient </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    testEnv   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">envtest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Environment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx       </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cancel    </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CancelFunc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"