手动模拟 Pod status 更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"e2e-测试-真实集群\">E2E 测试：真实集群</h2><p>E2E 测试在真实（但轻量级）的 Kubernetes 集群中验证 Operator 的完整行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 Kind 创建测试集群&#10;kind create cluster --name operator-e2e --config=test/e2e/kind-config.yaml&#10;&#10;# 部署 Operator&#10;make docker-build IMG=operator:e2e&#10;kind load docker-image operator:e2e --name operator-e2e&#10;make deploy IMG=operator:e2e&#10;&#10;# 运行 E2E 测试&#10;go test ./test/e2e/ -v -timeout 30m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 Kind 创建测试集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cluster</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator-e2e</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --config=test/e2e/kind-config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 部署 Operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> IMG=operator:e2e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> load</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator:e2e</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> operator-e2e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> IMG=operator:e2e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行 E2E 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./test/e2e/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -timeout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 30m</span></span></code></pre></div><p>E2E 测试验证的典型场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>创建 CR</td>\n<td>所有子资源被正确创建，最终 Ready=True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改 spec.replicas</td>\n<td>StatefulSet 正确扩缩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除 CR</td>\n<td>所有子资源被级联删除，外部资源被清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Operator Pod 重启</td>\n<td>调谐恢复，无资源泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本升级</td>\n<td>滚动升级完成，零停机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点故障</td>\n<td>自动 failover，数据不丢失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"故障注入测试\">故障注入测试</h2><p>生产级 Operator 必须验证在异常条件下的行为。故障注入测试模拟真实生产中的失败场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Chaos Mesh: 模拟网络分区&#10;apiVersion: chaos-mesh.org/v1alpha1&#10;kind: NetworkChaos&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: partition-operator-from-apiserver&#10;spec:&#10;  action: partition&#10;  mode: all&#10;  selector:&#10;    labelSelectors:&#10;      app: database-operator&#10;  direction: both&#10;  target:&#10;    selector:&#10;      labelSelectors:&#10;        component: kube-apiserver&#10;  duration: &#39;30s&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Chaos Mesh: 模拟网络分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">chaos-mesh.org/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkChaos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">partition-operator-from-apiserver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">partition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    labelSelectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">both</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labelSelectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kube-apiserver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30s'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障类型</th>\n<th>模拟方式</th>\n<th>预期行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API Server 不可达</td>\n<td>网络分区</td>\n<td>Operator 重连后继续调谐，无数据损坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Operator 被杀</td>\n<td>Kill Pod</td>\n<td>Leader 切换，调谐恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>etcd 延迟</td>\n<td>注入网络延迟</td>\n<td>调谐变慢但不出错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘满</td>\n<td>填满 PVC</td>\n<td>优雅降级，报告 Degraded Condition</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟偏移</td>\n<td>修改 Pod 内时钟</td>\n<td>证书不过期，续约正常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测试中的时间处理\">测试中的时间处理</h2><p>Operator 测试中最常见的问题是<strong>异步等待</strong>——你创建了 CR，但 Reconciler 需要若干循环才能完成所有子资源的创建。正确的模式是使用 <code>Eventually</code>（轮询等待）而非 <code>Sleep</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 正确：Eventually 轮询直到条件满足&#10;require.Eventually(t, func() bool {&#10;    var db databasev1.Database&#10;    if err := k8sClient.Get(ctx, key, &amp;db); err != nil {&#10;        return false&#10;    }&#10;    return meta.IsStatusConditionTrue(db.Status.Conditions, &quot;Ready&quot;)&#10;}, 30*time.Second, 500*time.Millisecond)&#10;&#10;// 错误：硬编码 Sleep（脆弱、浪费时间）&#10;// time.Sleep(10 * time.Second)  // 不要这样做\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：Eventually 轮询直到条件满足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">require.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Eventually</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k8sClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, key, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meta.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IsStatusConditionTrue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db.Status.Conditions, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ready\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Second, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Millisecond)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误：硬编码 Sleep（脆弱、浪费时间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// time.Sleep(10 * time.Second)  // 不要这样做</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测试覆盖率策略\">测试覆盖率策略</h2><p>Operator 测试的覆盖率不应以代码行覆盖率为唯一指标——更重要的是<strong>状态空间覆盖率</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[状态空间] --&gt; B[正常路径: Create/Update/Delete]&#10;    A --&gt; C[错误路径: API 错误/超时/冲突]&#10;    A --&gt; D[边界条件: 空 spec/零值/最大值]&#10;    A --&gt; E[并发场景: 同时修改/重复事件]&#10;    A --&gt; F[恢复场景: 崩溃后重启/Leader 切换]\">flowchart LR\n    A[状态空间] --&gt; B[正常路径: Create/Update/Delete]\n    A --&gt; C[错误路径: API 错误/超时/冲突]\n    A --&gt; D[边界条件: 空 spec/零值/最大值]\n    A --&gt; E[并发场景: 同时修改/重复事件]\n    A --&gt; F[恢复场景: 崩溃后重启/Leader 切换]</pre><p>对于每个 Reconcile 路径分支，都应有对应的测试用例覆盖。特别关注：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reconcile 返回 error 后的重试行为</li>\n<li>资源已存在时的 CreateOrUpdate 幂等性</li>\n<li>Finalizer 清理逻辑在各种失败场景下的表现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Operator 测试策略的核心是分层覆盖：纯函数逻辑用单元测试（极快、高覆盖）、调谐循环用 envtest 集成测试（秒级、覆盖 API 交互）、完整部署用 E2E 测试（分钟级、真实集群）、故障容忍用混沌测试（定期、模拟生产异常）。设计 Reconciler 时主动分离纯计算层和 API 交互层以提高可测试性。异步断言使用 Eventually 模式而非 Sleep。覆盖率关注状态空间（路径分支）而非仅代码行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"operator-lifecycle-manager\">Operator Lifecycle Manager</a>——测试通过后的分发与发布流程</li>\n<li><a href=\"operator-observability\">Operator 可观测性</a>——测试中验证指标暴露的正确性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Operator 测试策略与实践","id":"operator-测试策略与实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测试金字塔","id":"测试金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"单元测试：纯逻辑验证","id":"单元测试-纯逻辑验证"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试：envtest","id":"集成测试-envtest"},{"level":2,"text":"E2E 测试：真实集群","id":"e2e-测试-真实集群"},{"level":2,"text":"故障注入测试","id":"故障注入测试"},{"level":2,"text":"测试中的时间处理","id":"测试中的时间处理"},{"level":2,"text":"测试覆盖率策略","id":"测试覆盖率策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"多集群 Operator 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/multi-cluster-operators"},"next":{"title":"Operator Lifecycle Manager 与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/operations/operator-lifecycle-manager"}}